  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know, I know, this could be easily abused, that is unLESS, the report button is only available on the profiles of users who can provide evidence of physical issues through the means of official paper documents etc. In the past 2 weeks I've had the terrible experience of seeing 2 different people have seizures, and there's nothing we can do about the situation to help. 90% of us would request a mod and none would arrive. So please, VRC Devs, add in some means of reporting an emergency, without the system being able to be abused.",
